  <name>Vivi</name>
  <summary>Fast, lightweight media player</summary>
  <developer id="io.github.loafer19">
    <name>Loafer19</name>
  </developer>
  <description>
    <p>
      Vivi is a fast, minimal media player built on mpv, inspired by Juxtopposed's VLC redesign.
      It plays nearly any video or audio file, remembers where you stopped and stays out of your way.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Hardware-accelerated playback powered by libmpv</li>
      <li>Music and video library with artwork</li>
      <li>Audio equalizer and video filters</li>
      <li>Subtitles, chapters and playlists</li>
      <li>MPRIS media keys and a compact miniplayer</li>
      <li>Downloadable plugins</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
